<h2>Universal DocAct Expectations by Task Verb</h2>
<p>Use this when adding new document-related progress tasks:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Task verb/pattern</th>
<th>Expected DocAct slot</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>Collect ... Documents</code></td>
<td><code>act1</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Upload ...</code></td>
<td><code>act1</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Create ...</code></td>
<td><code>act1</code>, or <code>actFin</code> when approval/signature is built into the artifact</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Verify ... Documents</code></td>
<td>positive <code>actDest</code> or <code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Approve ...</code></td>
<td>positive <code>actDest</code> or <code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Reject ...</code></td>
<td>negative/destructive <code>actDest</code>; do not satisfy the underlying required document</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Sign ...</code></td>
<td><code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Code ...</code></td>
<td>positive <code>actDest</code> or <code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Record Actual ... Expenses</code></td>
<td>positive <code>actDest</code> or <code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>Complete ... Workbook</code></td>
<td><code>actFin</code></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Inference Logic</h2>
<pre><code class="language-mermaid">flowchart TD
    A["Progress task requires document evidence"] --&gt; B["Find expected DocCode family"]
    B --&gt; C["Find project-linked file/document"]
    C --&gt; D{"DocCode matches?"}
    D --&gt;|"No"| X["Do not infer complete"]
    D --&gt;|"Yes"| E["Read linked Doc Events"]
    E --&gt; F{"Expected DocAct present?"}
    F --&gt;|"Upload/collect task: act1"| G["Infer complete"]
    F --&gt;|"Review/approve task: positive actDest or actFin"| G
    F --&gt;|"Sign/final task: actFin"| G
    F --&gt;|"Reject task: negative actDest"| H["Infer rejection task complete only"]
    F --&gt;|"Missing or wrong action"| X
    H --&gt; I["Underlying document remains unsatisfied"]</code></pre>
<h2>Recommended Key</h2>
<p>For Progress V2 completion records, use a deterministic key shaped like:</p>
<pre><code class="language-text">{projectRecordId}:{phaseTaskId}:{docCodeId}:{docActId}</code></pre>
<p>For collection tasks where any one of several accepted documents can satisfy a requirement, include the accepted-document group:</p>
<pre><code class="language-text">{projectRecordId}:{phaseTaskId}:{docRequirementGroup}:{docCodeId}:{docActId}</code></pre>
<p>This prevents a rejected contract from completing the signed contract task, and prevents an uploaded estimate from completing the estimate approval task.</p>
